# text = Sigemunde gesprong æfter dēaðdæge dōm unlȳtel, syþðban wīges heard wyrm ācwealde, hordes hyrde; hē under hārne stān, æþelinges bearn āna genēðde frēcne dǣde, ne wæs him Fitela mid; hwæþre him gesǣlde, ðæt þæt swurd þurhwōd wrǣtīcne wyrm, þæt hit on wealle ætstōd, dryhtlīc īren; draca morðre swealt.
