# text = Ic hine hrædlīce heardan clammum on wælbedde wrīpan þōhte, þæt hē for mundgripe mīnum scolde licgean līfbysig, būtan his līc swice; ic hine ne mihte, þā Metod nolde, ganges getwǣman, nō ic him ǣæs georne ætfealh, feorhgenīðlan; wæs tō foremihtig fēond on fēþe.
