# reading_translation = I quickly intended to wrap him in hard grips on the slaughter-bed, so that he, because of my hand-grip, would lie struggling for life, unless his body should escape; I could not, since the Measurer did not allow it, keep him from going, nor did I, therefore, eagerly cling to him, the life-enemy; the foe was too overwhelmingly mighty in his advance.
