# sent_id = beowulf.00314
# text = þæt gesȳne wearþ, widcūþ werum, þætte wrecend þā gȳt lifde æfter lāþum, lange þrāge, æfter gūðceare; Grendles mōdor, ides āglǣcwīf yrmþe gemunde, sē þe wæteregesan wunian scolde, cealde strēamas, siþðan Cāin wearð tō ecgbanan āngan brēþer, fæderenmǣge; hē þā fāg gewāt, morþre gemearcod mandrēam fleon, wēsten warode.
# ref = 1255-1265
# source_version = perseus-ang1
# model = deepseek-chat
# reading_translation = That became evident, widely known to men, that an avenger still lived after the hostile one, for a long time, after the war-sorrow; Grendel's mother, a lady, a monstrous woman, remembered the misery, she who had to dwell in the water-terror, the cold streams, after Cain became the sword-slayer of his only brother, his father's kinsman; he then departed guilty, marked by murder, to flee mankind's joy, he inhabited the wasteland.
# literal_translation = That seen became, widely-known to-men, that an-avenger then still lived after the-hateful-one, a-long time, after war-sorrow; Grendel's mother, lady, monstrous-woman, misery remembered, she who water-terror to-dwell should, cold streams, after Cain became to sword-slayer of-only brother, father's-kinsman; he then guilty departed, with-murder marked, mankind's-joy to-flee, wasteland inhabited.
